From adbce27079f05e3184957a56ccd47865ec1f188d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joshua-Eisenhart <joshua.eisenhart@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 20:47:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] constraintbox: process-order ratchet, operational gate IDs,
 model-binding enforcement

Three additions, all uncommitted until now and all built this session.

process_ratchet.py: rung advance is refused unless every lower rung re-validates
from bytes. Reuses HashChainLedger.append/verify (full re-walk from GENESIS on
every advance) rather than a new chain. Admissibility is one FiniteConstraintProblem
decided by dual_solve, with enumerated domains: ledger in {intact,broken},
chain in {prefix_of_ladder,diverged}, extension in {next,already_recorded,out_of_order}.
sha256 over byte strings stays in Python; only its enumerated outcome enters the spec.
Three controls pass: out-of-order refused, silent reversion caught, honest advance allowed.

gate_operations.py: binds four of the six cb:*-gate IDs to code that actually runs,
each emitting an execution receipt (input sha256, output sha256, verdict). Before this
all six IDs appeared only in boundary_contract.py as vocabulary an agent asserts.
cb:sympy-exact-gate and cb:maude-transition-gate remain declaration-only.

agentrun.py + providers.py: model-binding enforcement. model_resolved is recomputed
from codex's own session rollout (turn_context.model), never from the requested slug.
MODEL_RESOLVED_MISMATCH blocks, MODEL_RESOLVED_UNAVAILABLE parks, both recomputed
independently in _release_safety. Negative control fired: requested gpt-5.6-luna,
gpt-5.6-sol answered, gate caught it. Also repins estate_controller to the sha of the
shipped estate.py, which had been reverted twice.

flow_termination.py: z3 asserts that a cycle traversable without consuming the retry
budget exists; UNSAT is the termination proof.

Suite 956 tests, 8 failures, 25 errors -- unchanged from baseline; the 18 new tests pass.
Nothing here is promoted; promotion_allowed stays false.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
